{"title":"Dentist Roadmap","role":"Dentist","summary":"A Dentist is a dental healthcare professional who assesses, prevents, diagnoses within their permitted scope, and treats conditions affecting the teeth, gums, oral cavity and related structures.","facts":{"Current degree":"BDS (Bachelor of Dental Surgery)","Course":"Dental Surgery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Dentist is a dental healthcare professional who assesses, prevents, diagnoses within their permitted scope, and treats conditions affecting the teeth, gums, oral cavity and related structures."},{"type":"p","text":"A BDS graduate can build a career across:"},{"type":"h","text":"General dental practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental hospitals and clinics"},{"type":"h","text":"Government healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate dental chains"},{"type":"h","text":"Community dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental public health"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental research"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare administration"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Dentistry is a regulated healthcare profession. A BDS degree alone should not be treated as unrestricted authorization to practise independently. The graduate must satisfy the applicable registration, internship and professional requirements in the jurisdiction where they intend to practise. Scope of practice also depends on applicable regulations and professional credentials."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Typical Responsibilities"],"rows":[[{"text":"General Dentistry"},{"text":"Routine oral examination and dental treatment"}],[{"text":"Preventive Dentistry"},{"text":"Oral hygiene and disease prevention"}],[{"text":"Restorative Dentistry"},{"text":"Management of damaged or decayed teeth"}],[{"text":"Periodontal Care"},{"text":"Gum and supporting-tissue care"}],[{"text":"Prosthodontics"},{"text":"Replacement/restoration of missing or damaged teeth"}],[{"text":"Oral Surgery"},{"text":"Minor oral surgical procedures within permitted scope"}],[{"text":"Paediatric Dentistry"},{"text":"Dental care for children"}],[{"text":"Community Dentistry"},{"text":"Population-level oral-health programs"}],[{"text":"Dental Public Health"},{"text":"Prevention and oral-health promotion"}],[{"text":"Dental Research"},{"text":"Clinical and laboratory research"}],[{"text":"Dental Education"},{"text":"Teaching and academic dentistry"}],[{"text":"Dental Administration"},{"text":"Clinic and healthcare management"}],[{"text":"Digital Dentistry"},{"text":"CAD/CAM, digital impressions and workflows"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap"},{"type":"h","text":"BDS Admission"},{"type":"h","text":"Pre-clinical + Basic Medical Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Pre-clinical Dental Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Dental Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Rotations / Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Required Professional Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"General Dentist / Dental Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialization / Advanced Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Dentist / Senior Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Clinical / Academic / Administrative Role"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Practice / Dental Organization Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"What to Build During the Degree"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Basic Medical & Dental Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral biology"},{"type":"h","text":"Histology"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic medical sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Focus"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Tooth morphology"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection-control principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic medical history taking"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Pre-Clinical Dental Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Pre-clinical prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pre-clinical conservative dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop strong understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental caries"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal disease"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral infections"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic restorative techniques"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Clinical Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop clinical exposure in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservative dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Paediatric dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Orthodontics fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Build competence in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiographic interpretation fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive counselling"},{"type":"h","text":"Chairside procedures under supervision"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Integrated Clinical Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on integrating:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Diagnosis","Treatment Planning","Clinical Procedure","Follow-up","Prevention"]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Comprehensive patient assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment sequencing"},{"type":"h","text":"Multidisciplinary referrals"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency dental care fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection control"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical decision-making"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete the required clinical training/internship and professional requirements applicable to the jurisdiction."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Skills to Develop"],"rows":[[{"text":"Clinical Examination"},{"text":"Oral examination and history taking"}],[{"text":"Diagnosis"},{"text":"Identification of dental conditions within scope"}],[{"text":"Treatment Planning"},{"text":"Prioritizing treatment and referrals"}],[{"text":"Restorative Dentistry"},{"text":"Management of caries/damaged teeth"}],[{"text":"Periodontal Care"},{"text":"Gum-health assessment and management"}],[{"text":"Prosthodontics"},{"text":"Basic restorative/replacement procedures"}],[{"text":"Oral Surgery"},{"text":"Appropriate minor procedures within scope"}],[{"text":"Paediatric Dentistry"},{"text":"Child-focused dental care"}],[{"text":"Radiology"},{"text":"Dental imaging fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Infection Control"},{"text":"Sterilization and clinical safety"}],[{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Dental medication principles"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Patient counselling and informed consent"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Clinical records and treatment notes"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical + Dental History"},{"type":"h","text":"Extraoral Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Intraoral Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigations / Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnosis"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Communication & Consent"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-Treatment Instructions"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong dentist should develop systematic examination skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment Framework"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Complaint"},{"type":"h","text":"History of Present Complaint"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical History"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental History"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Differential Considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnosis"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to recognize when a case requires referral to a specialist or another healthcare professional."},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Dentistry"},{"type":"p","text":"Prevention should be a core part of dental practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Educate patients about:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brushing technique"},{"type":"h","text":"Fluoride"},{"type":"h","text":"Flossing/interdental cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Diet and sugar exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Tobacco-related oral-health risks"},{"type":"h","text":"Regular dental examinations"},{"type":"h","text":"Gum health"},{"type":"h","text":"Early detection of oral abnormalities"},{"type":"h","text":"Prevention Model"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Hygiene"},{"type":"h","text":"Dietary Guidance"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Intervention"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodic Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Restorative Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop foundational knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental caries"},{"type":"h","text":"Tooth preparation"},{"type":"h","text":"Restorative materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Composite restorations"},{"type":"h","text":"Amalgam principles where applicable"},{"type":"h","text":"Adhesive dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Pulp protection"},{"type":"h","text":"Occlusion fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Restoration maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical procedures must be performed according to training, supervision requirements and applicable professional standards."},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Gingivitis"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontitis"},{"type":"h","text":"Plaque and calculus"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral hygiene instruction"},{"type":"h","text":"Scaling principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal maintenance"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk factors"},{"type":"p","text":"A dentist should also recognize cases requiring specialist periodontal management."},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Build foundational knowledge in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Crowns"},{"type":"h","text":"Bridges"},{"type":"h","text":"Complete dentures"},{"type":"h","text":"Partial dentures"},{"type":"h","text":"Impressions"},{"type":"h","text":"Occlusion"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthetic treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant dentistry fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced procedures may require additional training and specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental extractions"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgical principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Local anaesthesia"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-operative care"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection management"},{"type":"h","text":"Complications"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency management"},{"type":"h","text":"Referral criteria"},{"type":"p","text":"Patient safety and recognition of cases beyond one's competence are critical."},{"type":"h","text":"Paediatric Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Child communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Behaviour management"},{"type":"h","text":"Prevention"},{"type":"h","text":"Caries management"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral hygiene education"},{"type":"h","text":"Primary dentition"},{"type":"h","text":"Mixed dentition"},{"type":"h","text":"Early identification of developmental problems"},{"type":"h","text":"Referral to paediatric dental specialists"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Radiology & Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Intraoral radiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Panoramic imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Cephalometric concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital radiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Image quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern dental practice increasingly incorporates 3D imaging and digital workflows, but interpretation and use must remain within the professional's training and applicable scope."},{"type":"h","text":"Infection Prevention & Patient Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hand hygiene"},{"type":"h","text":"PPE"},{"type":"h","text":"Instrument sterilization"},{"type":"h","text":"Disinfection"},{"type":"h","text":"Sharps safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Biomedical waste management"},{"type":"h","text":"Cross-infection prevention"},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental hygiene"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical emergency preparedness"},{"type":"p","text":"This should become a routine part of every clinical workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Modern dentists should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital intraoral scanners"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital impressions"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD/CAM"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital smile design"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital radiography"},{"type":"h","text":"CBCT fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"3D printing"},{"type":"h","text":"Chairside milling"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic dental records"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Dentistry Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Scan / Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Model"},{"type":"h","text":"Computer-Aided Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD Design"},{"type":"h","text":"CAM / 3D Printing"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Try-in"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"AI in Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"AI is becoming increasingly relevant in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental-image analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Caries detection"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal risk assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiographic interpretation assistance"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment planning support"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient-risk prediction"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment optimization"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental practice analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"AI should function as a decision-support tool, not a substitute for professional clinical judgment."},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Practice Management"},{"type":"p","text":"For graduates interested in private practice, learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment management"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory management"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental billing"},{"type":"h","text":"Staff coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection-control auditing"},{"type":"h","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinic finances"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient retention"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare marketing ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital record management"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinic Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Consent"},{"type":"h","text":"Procedure"},{"type":"h","text":"Billing"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"},{"type":"h","text":"Recall / Preventive Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Preparedness"},{"type":"p","text":"Dentists should understand recognition and initial management principles for situations such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Syncope"},{"type":"h","text":"Allergic reactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Hypoglycaemia"},{"type":"h","text":"Asthma-related emergencies"},{"type":"h","text":"Seizures"},{"type":"h","text":"Chest-pain emergencies"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiorespiratory emergencies"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain appropriate emergency preparedness and know when to activate emergency medical support."},{"type":"h","text":"Research Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"A strong dentist should be able to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Read clinical research papers"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand study designs"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluate evidence quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Perform literature searches"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand basic statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Apply evidence-based dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Present clinical research"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature Search"},{"type":"h","text":"Study Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-Based Decision"},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"AI-Assisted Dental Imaging","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study the use of AI for identifying dental conditions from radiographic images."}]},{"heading":"Digital Dentistry Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design a digital workflow integrating:"},{"type":"h","text":"Intraoral scanning"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"h","text":"3D printing"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment planning"}]},{"heading":"Oral Health Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Conduct a community study examining:"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral-hygiene practices"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental-care awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Diet"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental-visit frequency"}]},{"heading":"Dental Caries Risk Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a risk-assessment framework based on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Diet"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral hygiene"},{"type":"h","text":"Previous caries"},{"type":"h","text":"Fluoride exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle factors"}]},{"heading":"Dental Clinic Management Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel / Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"to track:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient visits"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment categories"},{"type":"h","text":"Revenue"},{"type":"h","text":"Recall rates"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment cancellations"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient retention"},{"type":"h","text":"Internship / Clinical Training Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Because dentistry is clinically regulated, practical clinical exposure is particularly important."},{"type":"h","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Multiple dental specialties"},{"type":"h","text":"High patient volume"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical protocols"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency cases"},{"type":"h","text":"Government Dental Hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Community dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Public-health programs"},{"type":"h","text":"Diverse patient populations"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Private Dental Clinics"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"General practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Practice management"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Chains"},{"type":"h","text":"Exposure to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Standardized clinical protocols"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-specialty dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital records"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio to Build"},{"type":"p","text":"For dentistry, a portfolio should emphasize clinical competence, academic work and professional development, while respecting patient privacy."},{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Item","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Clinical Case Presentations"},{"text":"10+"}],[{"text":"Case Reports / Case Analyses"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Oral-Health Awareness Projects"},{"text":"2+"}],[{"text":"Research Projects"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Dental Seminars / Presentations"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Community Dentistry Activities"},{"text":"2+"}],[{"text":"Digital Dentistry Projects"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Dental Workshops / Training"},{"text":"3+"}],[{"text":"Clinical Internship"},{"text":"Required / as applicable"}],[{"text":"Academic Poster / Paper"},{"text":"1+"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Never include identifiable patient photographs or medical information in a public portfolio without appropriate authorization and consent."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After completing the required degree, internship and professional requirements, potential roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"General Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Associate Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Surgeon"},{"type":"h","text":"Community Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Public-Health Dental Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Clinical Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Practice Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Private Dental Clinic"},{"text":"General clinical dentistry + communication"}],[{"text":"Dental Hospital"},{"text":"Broad clinical exposure"}],[{"text":"Government Healthcare"},{"text":"Clinical + public-health skills"}],[{"text":"Corporate Dental Chain"},{"text":"Clinical + patient management"}],[{"text":"Dental Research Organization"},{"text":"Research + evidence-based dentistry"}],[{"text":"Dental Technology Company"},{"text":"Digital dentistry + clinical knowledge"}],[{"text":"Dental Education Institution"},{"text":"Clinical + academic skills"}],[{"text":"Public Health Program"},{"text":"Community dentistry + communication"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"p","text":"After BDS, specialization can be pursued through applicable postgraduate pathways."},{"type":"h","text":"Major Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservative Dentistry & Endodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontology"},{"type":"h","text":"Orthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Medicine & Radiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Paediatric & Preventive Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Dentistry"},{"type":"p","text":"Other possible academic/professional directions include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Biology"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility, admission and professional recognition requirements vary by jurisdiction and current regulations."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"A dentist can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"General Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Endodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Orthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Paediatric Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Radiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Cosmetic/Aesthetic Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Education"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BDS Student"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Registered / Eligible Dental Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"General Dentist / Dental Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experienced Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Dentist / Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Department Head"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Clinic / Healthcare Organization Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative entrepreneurship pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"BDS"},{"type":"h","text":"General Dentist"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-Chair Clinic"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-Specialty Dental Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Healthcare Business"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"The dental profession is increasingly moving toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"3D printing"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD/CAM dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Teledentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital orthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Clear aligner technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Personalized preventive dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental robotics"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental practice analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Remote patient monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Regenerative dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Biomaterials"},{"type":"h","text":"Precision oral healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"DENTIST"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"┌────────────────┼────────────────┐"},{"type":"h","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Diagnosis Preventive Care Treatment Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"h","text":"└────────────────┼────────────────┘"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"┌───────────────────┼───────────────────┐"},{"type":"h","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"h","text":"Restorative Periodontal Prosthodontic"},{"type":"h","text":"Dentistry Care Knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"h","text":"└───────────────────┼───────────────────┘"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection Control"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-Based Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"AI + Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"h","text":"A strong BDS graduate should be able to:"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct systematic dental history and examination."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop appropriate treatment plans within their competence."},{"type":"p","text":"Provide preventive oral-health counselling."},{"type":"p","text":"Perform clinical procedures according to training and applicable scope."},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain accurate clinical records."},{"type":"p","text":"Follow infection-control and patient-safety protocols."},{"type":"p","text":"Communicate treatment options clearly."},{"type":"p","text":"Recognize cases requiring specialist referral."},{"type":"p","text":"Handle common dental emergencies according to training."},{"type":"p","text":"Interpret basic dental imaging appropriately."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand evidence-based dentistry."},{"type":"p","text":"Use digital dental technologies."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand CAD/CAM and digital-imaging workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"Participate in community oral-health programs."},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct basic clinical research."},{"type":"p","text":"Use healthcare technology and AI responsibly."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BDS","Strong Clinical Dentistry","Preventive Care","Patient Communication","Evidence-Based Practice","Infection Control","Digital Dentistry","Imaging","CAD/CAM","AI-Assisted Dentistry","Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile combines clinical competence with digital dentistry and evidence-based practice. Graduates can then choose between general dental practice, postgraduate specialization, public health, research, academics, dental technology, healthcare management or building their own dental practice, subject to applicable professional registration and regulatory requirements."}]}]}